<title>FRANCE: Rouen April 1-9 flour exports 19,175 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen April 1-9 flour exports 19,175 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 19,175 tonnes between April 1 and April 9, port officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 63,000 tonnes for the whole of April 1996.</p>
<p>April 1-9 exports included 8,150 tonnes for west Africa and 11,025 tonnes for Cuba, they said.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
